Star Nest by Pablo Roman Andrioli (Kali)
https://www.shadertoy.com/view/XlfGRj

The author's notice in the shader reads "This content is under the MIT License."
in the copy this port was made from, and "License: MIT" in the Shadertoy API
record of the same shader (mirrored at
https://github.com/GabeRundlett/shadertoy-api-shaders). Both say the same thing.

Ported to Metal Shading Language for MacOS Live Wallpaper; see the note at the
top of main.metal for what was changed.

